    "chapter": "05 函数与模块化",
    "cReference": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n#include <string.h>\n#include <stddef.h>\n#include <limits.h>\ntypedef struct{long long sum;int leaves,depth;}Result;static Result parse(int depth){char token[32];Result r={0,0,depth};if(scanf(\"%31s\",token)!=1)return r;if(strcmp(token,\"G\")){r.sum=strtoll(token,NULL,10);r.leaves=1;return r;}Result a=parse(depth+1),b=parse(depth+1);r.sum=a.sum+b.sum;r.leaves=a.leaves+b.leaves;r.depth=a.depth>b.depth?a.depth:b.depth;return r;}int main(void){Result r=parse(0);printf(\"%lld %d %d\\n\",r.sum,r.leaves,r.depth);return 0;}\n",
    "oracleNotes": "Independent iterative pending-slot traversal, not recursive parsing; leaf sum/count/depth invariants."
  }
